{
	"pages": [
		{
			"id": "OrgUnitDetail",
			"route": "/org-units/:id",
			"type": "detail",
			"title": "Organisational unit",
			"config": {
				"register": "humaniq",
				"schema": "OrgUnit",
				"_note": "org-chart-basic (2026-07-13): humaniq's first organisational-hierarchy schema. The data widget excludes parentUnitId/managerId since Related already resolves and links both by name (the EmployeeDetail exclude convention). Two FK-scoped object-lists cover the hierarchy's two directions: 'Child units' (OrgUnit.parentUnitId = @objectId, the self-referencing tree) and 'Assignments' (OrgAssignment.orgUnitId = @objectId, who is currently/historically placed here). No lifecycleActions: neither OrgUnit nor OrgAssignment carries an x-openregister-lifecycle (design.md D-table) — a plain record toggled active/inactive, not a workflow (PayrollRunDetail 'never invent a transition' precedent). No stat/stats-block KPI: a unit's headline facts (type/costCenter/active) are plain enum/string/boolean fields the stat widget's count/sum metric cannot echo (LoonaangifteFilingDetail/PensionFilingDetail precedent), so they surface in the data widget instead. Audit history is a sidebar tab. people-formation-positions (2026-09-28): four stat tiles (budgeted, filled, vacant, net FTE for the unit) and an object-table of the unit's places, all bound through endpointSource to GET /api/formation/occupancy, which computes them on read; built-in widgets only (ADR-049), the endpoint does the cross-schema, absence-weighted count.",
				"sidebar": {
					"enabled": true,
					"showMetadata": true
				},
				"widgets": [
					{
						"id": "data",
						"type": "data",
						"title": "Organisational unit",
						"icon": "SitemapOutline",
						"content": {
							"columns": 2,
							"exclude": [
								"parentUnitId",
								"managerId"
							],
							"title": "Organisational unit"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "related",
						"type": "related",
						"title": "Related",
						"icon": "LinkVariant",
						"content": {
							"title": "Related"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "object-list",
						"type": "object-list",
						"title": "Child units",
						"icon": "SitemapOutline",
						"content": {
							"register": "humaniq",
							"schema": "OrgUnit",
							"filter": {
								"parentUnitId": "@objectId"
							},
							"sort": {
								"field": "name",
								"dir": "asc"
							},
							"columns": [
								{
									"key": "name",
									"label": "Name"
								},
								{
									"key": "type",
									"label": "Type"
								},
								{
									"key": "costCenter",
									"label": "Cost center"
								},
								{
									"key": "active",
									"label": "Active"
								}
							],
							"limit": 25,
							"rowRoute": "OrgUnitDetail",
							"viewAllRoute": "OrgUnits",
							"viewAllQuery": {
								"parentUnitId": "@objectId"
							},
							"emptyText": "No child units yet"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "object-list-2",
						"type": "object-list",
						"title": "Assignments",
						"icon": "AccountArrowRightOutline",
						"content": {
							"register": "humaniq",
							"schema": "OrgAssignment",
							"filter": {
								"orgUnitId": "@objectId"
							},
							"sort": {
								"field": "startDate",
								"dir": "desc"
							},
							"columns": [
								{
									"key": "employeeId",
									"label": "Employee"
								},
								{
									"key": "role",
									"label": "Role"
								},
								{
									"key": "startDate",
									"label": "Start"
								},
								{
									"key": "endDate",
									"label": "End"
								}
							],
							"limit": 25,
							"rowRoute": "OrgAssignmentDetail",
							"viewAllRoute": "OrgAssignments",
							"viewAllQuery": {
								"orgUnitId": "@objectId"
							},
							"emptyText": "No placements yet"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "formation-budgetedFte",
						"type": "stat",
						"title": "Budgeted FTE",
						"icon": "CalculatorVariantOutline",
						"content": {
							"label": "Budgeted FTE",
							"icon": "CalculatorVariantOutline",
							"format": {
								"style": "number",
								"decimals": 2
							},
							"endpointSource": {
								"url": "/apps/humaniq/api/formation/occupancy",
								"params": {
									"orgUnitId": "@objectId"
								}
							},
							"valueField": "total.budgetedFte"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "formation-filledFte",
						"type": "stat",
						"title": "Filled FTE",
						"icon": "AccountMultipleOutline",
						"content": {
							"label": "Filled FTE",
							"icon": "AccountMultipleOutline",
							"format": {
								"style": "number",
								"decimals": 2
							},
							"endpointSource": {
								"url": "/apps/humaniq/api/formation/occupancy",
								"params": {
									"orgUnitId": "@objectId"
								}
							},
							"valueField": "total.filledFte"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "formation-vacantFte",
						"type": "stat",
						"title": "Vacant FTE",
						"icon": "AccountPlusOutline",
						"content": {
							"label": "Vacant FTE",
							"icon": "AccountPlusOutline",
							"format": {
								"style": "number",
								"decimals": 2
							},
							"endpointSource": {
								"url": "/apps/humaniq/api/formation/occupancy",
								"params": {
									"orgUnitId": "@objectId"
								}
							},
							"valueField": "total.vacantFte"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "formation-netFte",
						"type": "stat",
						"title": "Net FTE",
						"icon": "AccountClockOutline",
						"content": {
							"label": "Net FTE",
							"icon": "AccountClockOutline",
							"format": {
								"style": "number",
								"decimals": 2
							},
							"endpointSource": {
								"url": "/apps/humaniq/api/formation/occupancy",
								"params": {
									"orgUnitId": "@objectId"
								}
							},
							"valueField": "total.netFte"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "formation-places",
						"type": "endpoint-table",
						"title": "Formation",
						"content": {
							"endpointSource": {
								"url": "/apps/humaniq/api/formation/occupancy",
								"params": {
									"orgUnitId": "@objectId"
								},
								"responsePath": "places"
							},
							"columns": [
								{
									"key": "title",
									"label": "Formation place",
									"cellClass": "cn-cell--strong"
								},
								{
									"key": "budgetedFte",
									"label": "Budgeted FTE"
								},
								{
									"key": "filledFte",
									"label": "Filled FTE"
								},
								{
									"key": "vacantFte",
									"label": "Vacant FTE"
								},
								{
									"key": "netFte",
									"label": "Net FTE"
								},
								{
									"key": "overfilled",
									"label": "Overfilled"
								}
							],
							"rowRoute": "FormatieplaatsDetail",
							"emptyText": "No formation places yet"
						}
					}
				],
				"layout": [
					{
						"id": 1,
						"widgetId": "data",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 0,
						"gridWidth": 8,
						"gridHeight": 6
					},
					{
						"id": 2,
						"widgetId": "related",
						"gridX": 8,
						"gridY": 0,
						"gridWidth": 4,
						"gridHeight": 6
					},
					{
						"id": 3,
						"widgetId": "object-list",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 6,
						"gridWidth": 6,
						"gridHeight": 4
					},
					{
						"id": 4,
						"widgetId": "object-list-2",
						"gridX": 6,
						"gridY": 6,
						"gridWidth": 6,
						"gridHeight": 4
					},
					{
						"id": 5,
						"widgetId": "formation-budgetedFte",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 10,
						"gridWidth": 3,
						"gridHeight": 2
					},
					{
						"id": 6,
						"widgetId": "formation-filledFte",
						"gridX": 3,
						"gridY": 10,
						"gridWidth": 3,
						"gridHeight": 2
					},
					{
						"id": 7,
						"widgetId": "formation-vacantFte",
						"gridX": 6,
						"gridY": 10,
						"gridWidth": 3,
						"gridHeight": 2
					},
					{
						"id": 8,
						"widgetId": "formation-netFte",
						"gridX": 9,
						"gridY": 10,
						"gridWidth": 3,
						"gridHeight": 2
					},
					{
						"id": 9,
						"widgetId": "formation-places",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 12,
						"gridWidth": 12,
						"gridHeight": 5
					}
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "Organogram",
			"route": "/org/chart",
			"type": "dashboard",
			"title": "Organisation chart",
			"config": {
				"description": "Your organisation on a date: every unit, its manager and how many people are placed in it.",
				"_note": "people-org-chart-view D4 (REQ-OCV-001/002): a dashboard with one host widget (org-chart, OrgChartWidget.vue) over GET /api/org/chart: an expandable list (CnTreeView) and a drawn chart (CnRelationshipGraph, manual layout computed by OrgChartService). A dashboard, not type custom, because gate 69 ratchets custom pages.",
				"widgets": [
					{
						"id": "org-chart",
						"type": "org-chart",
						"title": "Organisation chart",
						"content": {}
					}
				],
				"layout": [
					{
						"id": 1,
						"widgetId": "org-chart",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 0,
						"gridWidth": 12,
						"gridHeight": 10
					}
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"pageInstances": [
		{
			"templateRef": "indexScaffold",
			"register": "humaniq",
			"schema": "OrgUnit",
			"params": {
				"id": "OrgUnits",
				"route": "/org-units",
				"title": "Organisational units",
				"columns": [
					"name",
					"type",
					"costCenter",
					"managerId",
					"active"
				],
				"sort": {
					"field": "name",
					"order": "asc"
				},
				"filters": [
					"type",
					"active"
				],
				"filter": {
					"administrationId": "@workspace.activeAdministrationId?"
				},
				"description": "Organisational hierarchy: departments, teams and cost centres, each optionally under a parent unit."
			}
		},
		{
			"templateRef": "indexScaffold",
			"register": "humaniq",
			"schema": "OrgAssignment",
			"params": {
				"id": "OrgAssignments",
				"route": "/org-assignments",
				"title": "Placements",
				"columns": [
					"employeeId",
					"orgUnitId",
					"role",
					"startDate",
					"endDate"
				],
				"sort": {
					"field": "startDate",
					"order": "desc"
				},
				"filters": [
					"role"
				],
				"filter": {
					"administrationId": "@workspace.activeAdministrationId?"
				},
				"description": "Effective-dated placements of employees in organisational units."
			}
		},
		{
			"templateRef": "simpleDetailScaffold",
			"register": "humaniq",
			"schema": "OrgAssignment",
			"params": {
				"id": "OrgAssignmentDetail",
				"route": "/org-assignments/:id",
				"title": "Placement",
				"dataTitle": "Placement",
				"dataIcon": "AccountArrowRightOutline",
				"relatedTitle": "Related",
				"gridHeight": 5,
				"note": "org-chart-basic (2026-07-13): a simple two-panel leaf like EmploymentContractDetail -- the data widget (role/startDate/endDate) excludes employeeId/orgUnitId since Related already resolves and links both the placed Employee and the OrgUnit by name. No child lists (nothing references an OrgAssignment by FK). No lifecycleActions: OrgAssignment carries no x-openregister-lifecycle -- effective-dating lives on startDate/endDate, not a workflow status (design.md D1). No files/calendar/comms leaves -- the schema declares no such linkedType or document field. Audit history is a sidebar tab.",
				"exclude": [
					"employeeId",
					"orgUnitId"
				]
			}
		}
	]
}
